{
  "_comment": "Plan for tools/sweep.py (mise run measure docs/plans/next-session-eq-sub.json <set>). Run sheet and context: next-session-eq-sub.md. Format: tools/README.md. One set = measurements/<date>/<set>/. The eq-* and nosub-seat sets were measured on 2026-11-22 with the old REW-driven script (deleted; this file's earlier format is in git).",
